  E --> F{Callback URL configured?}
  F -->|yes| G[FastAPI Callback Receiver]
  F -->|no| H[Polling Worker<br/>recordInfo + backoff]
  G --> I[Extract Result URLs]
  H --> I
  I --> J[Download Immediately]
  J --> K[Local outputs/]
  J --> L[SQLite Task Log]
  L --> M[Review Gate]
  K --> M
  M --> N{Approved?}
  N -->|yes| O[Publish / Archive / Remote Storage]
  N -->|no| P[Revise Prompt / Re-run]
  P --> A

